<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Shakarparian Guide" description="Privacy and third-party services used by this independent guide." noHeader><section class="legal-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Updated 20 October 2026</p></div></section><article class="legal-wrap"><p><a href="/en/">Back to the guide</a></p><h2>What connects to other services</h2><p>This independent visitor guide has no account, booking or payment form. The hosting provider receives technical request information needed to deliver and protect pages. Google Maps embedded on guide pages connects to Google and may use its own cookies and process your IP address and device information. An external link connects to its operator when opened. Photos are served from this website.</p><h2>Optional analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics loads only after you allow analytics. It can process identifiers, page views, device information and approximate location under Google's policies; it is not described here as anonymous. This site disables advertising personalisation signals. Rejecting analytics immediately disables this site's Analytics measurement; it does not disable Google's separate map frame.</p><h2>Your choice and storage</h2><p>The site uses local storage to remember your analytics choice. You can allow or reject it in <a href="/en/cookies/">Cookie Settings</a>. When a denial cannot be saved, it still applies immediately and a tab-session veto is used where storage permits. A failure message explains that the denial is not guaranteed in new tabs or browsers. Browser privacy controls can block third-party content or clear stored choices.</p><h2>Third-party policies</h2><p>See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a> for Maps and Analytics. The weather section links to the Pakistan Meteorological Department; it does not fetch a live forecast in your browser.</p></article></BaseLayout>
